FROM STARTING LINK: https://saveso-client.vercel.app

Online Storefront is what appears when first loading this link:
-Create login for new members, or login with existing credentials as a memeber (select username and password)

Access POS/Admin pages through storefront: LOGIN -> 'Log in as staff member'
-> ENTER:
-EMAIL: admin@saveso.com  PASSWORD: password (to access admin side)

-EMAIL: ana.lopez@saveso.com PASSWORD: password (to access grocery/pos side)

GenData:
GenData is a standalone C# program that can be run to populate most* tables of the Database.
It consists of predefined Sales, Seasons, Items, Sale & Season Discounts, Departments, etc.,
and randomly generated data such as Employees, Customers & Addresses.

To run the program open the solution file in a C# ide, and setup user secrets as follows:
{
    "DB_HOST": "saveso.mysql.database.azure.com",
    "DB_PORT": "3306",
    "DB_USER": "",
    "DB_PASSWORD": "",
    "DB_DATABASE": "saveso"
}
Replace the values of these fields with the information of the database to connect to.
After doing so the program can be run to add data into the tables.
